---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const articleSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Article",
      "@id": "https://mahindralifespaceshomes.in/articles/mahindra-rivenza-cost-sheet-pricing-breakdown-2026/#article",
      "headline": "Mahindra Rivenza Cost Sheet Breakdown 2026: All-Inclusive Pricing & Payment Milestones",
      "description": "Comprehensive buyer breakdown of Mahindra Rivenza cost sheet in Baner Annex, Mahalunge, Pune. Detailed analysis of 2, 3 & 4 BHK base prices, 7% stamp duty and metro cess, 5% GST, registration, and CLP construction-linked payment schedules.",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "Pune Real Estate Financial Advisory Desk"
      },
      "publisher": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "Mahindra Rivenza"
      },
      "datePublished": "2026-10-21",
      "dateModified": "2026-10-21"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Table",
      "about": "Mahindra Rivenza 2026 Unit-Wise All-Inclusive Cost Matrix"
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "@id": "https://mahindralifespaceshomes.in/articles/mahindra-rivenza-cost-sheet-pricing-breakdown-2026/#faq",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the all-inclusive starting price for a 2 BHK at Mahindra Rivenza?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The all-inclusive starting price for a 2 BHK Premium unit (635 sq.ft. carpet / 688 sq.ft. usable) starts at ₹90 Lakhs* base price, coming to approximately ₹1.01 Crore all-inclusive, including 5% stamp duty, 1% metro cess, 1% LBT, 5% GST, ₹30,000 registration fees, and infrastructure charges."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the standard payment schedule for booking an apartment at Mahindra Rivenza?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Mahindra Rivenza operates on a flexible Construction-Linked Payment (CLP) plan: 10% on booking token, 10% on registered agreement execution, and the remaining 80% distributed across milestone slab completions as verified by MahaRERA audit certificates."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Are there any hidden charges or floor rise escalations?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Mahindra Lifespaces maintains complete corporate transparency under MahaRERA PR1261012602102 & PM1261012602103. The sanctioned cost sheet details clubhouse maintenance, society formation deposits, piped gas connection, and legal levies upfront with zero hidden charges."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
};
---

<Layout
  title="Mahindra Rivenza Cost Sheet Breakdown 2026 | All-Inclusive Price"
  description="Exhaustive Mahindra Rivenza cost sheet analysis. 2, 3 & 4 BHK base prices, 7% stamp duty, 5% GST, registration, and CLP construction-linked payment milestones."
  canonical="https://mahindralifespaceshomes.in/articles/mahindra-rivenza-cost-sheet-pricing-breakdown-2026/"
  customSchema={articleSchema}
>
  <article class="pt-32 pb-24 bg-charcoal-950 text-stone-300">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-10">
      
      <!-- Article Header -->
      <div class="space-y-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-8">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-xs text-gold-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">
          <a href="/articles/" class="hover:underline">← All Research</a>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>Financial Planning</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>October 2026 Edition</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-stone-100 leading-tight">
          Mahindra Rivenza Cost Sheet Breakdown: All-Inclusive Pricing &amp; Payment Schedule
        </h1>

        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-stone-400 font-light leading-relaxed">
          For property buyers and IT investors in West Pune, evaluating the true "on-road" cost of an apartment is critical before committing booking capital. Below is an exhaustive deconstruction of the official Mahindra Rivenza cost sheet at Baner Annex (Mahalunge), covering base prices, government levies, GST, and construction-linked milestones.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content Body -->
      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8 text-stone-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-white">1. Master Cost Matrix: Typology-Wise All-Inclusive Estimates</h2>
        <p>
          Prices at Mahindra Rivenza are structured transparently in strict compliance with MahaRERA guidelines. The table below outlines the price components across the primary configurations:
        </p>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto my-6">
          <table class="w-full text-left text-xs border border-white/10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
            <thead class="bg-charcoal-900 text-gold-400 font-mono uppercase">
              <tr>
                <th class="p-3 border-b border-white/10">Configuration</th>
                <th class="p-3 border-b border-white/10">RERA Carpet Area</th>
                <th class="p-3 border-b border-white/10">Starting Base Price</th>
                <th class="p-3 border-b border-white/10">Govt. Taxes (7% + ₹30k)</th>
                <th class="p-3 border-b border-white/10">GST (5%)</th>
                <th class="p-3 border-b border-white/10">Approx. All-Inclusive*</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-white/5">
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-white">2 BHK Premium</td>
                <td class="p-3">635 sq.ft. (688 usable)</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-gold-400 font-bold">₹90,00,000*</td>
                <td class="p-3">₹6,60,000</td>
                <td class="p-3">₹4,50,000</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-emerald-400 font-bold">₹1,01,10,000*</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-white">2 BHK Luxury A</td>
                <td class="p-3">680 sq.ft. (735 usable)</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-gold-400 font-bold">₹96,00,000*</td>
                <td class="p-3">₹7,02,000</td>
                <td class="p-3">₹4,80,000</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-emerald-400 font-bold">₹1,07,82,000*</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-white">3 BHK Deluxe C</td>
                <td class="p-3">882 sq.ft. (995 usable)</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-gold-400 font-bold">₹1,31,00,000*</td>
                <td class="p-3">₹9,47,000</td>
                <td class="p-3">₹6,55,000</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-emerald-400 font-bold">₹1,47,02,000*</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-white">3 BHK Ultra Luxury B</td>
                <td class="p-3">1,065 sq.ft. (1,206 usable)</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-gold-400 font-bold">₹1,58,00,000*</td>
                <td class="p-3">₹11,36,000</td>
                <td class="p-3">₹7,90,000</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-emerald-400 font-bold">₹1,77,26,000*</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-white">4 BHK Luxury Sky Villa</td>
                <td class="p-3">1,465 sq.ft. (1,651 usable)</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-gold-400 font-bold">₹2,20,00,000*</td>
                <td class="p-3">₹15,70,000</td>
                <td class="p-3">₹11,00,000</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-emerald-400 font-bold">₹2,46,70,000*</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 italic">
          *Note: Government taxes include 5% Maharashtra Stamp Duty, 1% Pune Metro Cess, 1% Local Body Tax, and fixed ₹30,000 Registration. Maintenance, piped gas, and legal documentation fees are as per official agreement terms.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-white">2. Construction-Linked Payment (CLP) Schedule</h2>
        <p>
          Unlike unorganized builders demanding heavy upfront disbursements, Mahindra Lifespaces protects buyer capital via a milestone-governed Construction-Linked Payment schedule:
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-6">
          <div class="p-4 bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/10 rounded-xl space-y-2">
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-gold-400 uppercase font-bold">Milestone 01</div>
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Booking Token &amp; EOI Expression</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-stone-300">10% of total consideration paid at reservation.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/10 rounded-xl space-y-2">
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-gold-400 uppercase font-bold">Milestone 02</div>
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Agreement Execution &amp; Registration</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-stone-300">10% payable on formal MahaRERA agreement registration.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/10 rounded-xl space-y-2">
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-gold-400 uppercase font-bold">Milestones 03 to 08</div>
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Plinth, Podium &amp; Tower Slabs</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-stone-300">5% to 7.5% per verified structural slab completion.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/10 rounded-xl space-y-2">
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-gold-400 uppercase font-bold">Final Milestone</div>
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Occupancy Certificate &amp; Handover</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-stone-300">Final 5% payable on intimation of possession with OC.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-white">3. Home Loan Eligibility &amp; Bank Pre-Approvals</h2>
        <p>
          Mahindra Rivenza is pre-approved by all leading institutional lenders including State Bank of India (SBI), HDFC Bank, ICICI Bank, Axis Bank, and Kotak Mahindra Bank. At current home loan interest rates (~8.35%*):
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-stone-300">
          <li><strong>2 BHK Loan Amount (₹72 Lakhs / 80% LTV):</strong> Estimated EMI of ~₹61,800/month for a 20-year tenure.</li>
          <li><strong>3 BHK Loan Amount (₹1.05 Crore / 80% LTV):</strong> Estimated EMI of ~₹90,100/month for a 20-year tenure.</li>
          <li><strong>Tax Savings:</strong> Claim up to ₹2,00,000/year under Section 24(b) on interest and ₹1,50,000/year under Section 80C on principal repayment.</li>
        </ul>

      </div>

      <!-- Action Box -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-charcoal-900 via-charcoal-800 to-charcoal-900 border border-gold-400/30 rounded-2xl p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-2xl flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
        <div class="space-y-2 text-center md:text-left">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase text-gold-400 tracking-widest font-bold">Direct Developer Sales Office</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-white">Request Official Sanctioned Cost Sheet</h3>
          <p class="text-stone-300 text-xs sm:text-sm max-w-xl">
            Receive the exact unit-wise cost sheet with parking allocations, floor rise details, and custom payment plan calculations.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
          <a
            href="tel:+917744009295"
            class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-lg bg-gold-500 hover:bg-gold-400 text-charcoal-950 font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-lg text-center"
          >
            Call Desk: +91 7744009295
          </a>
          <a
            href="/tools/pune-stamp-duty-calculator/"
            class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-lg bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/15 border border-white/20 text-white font-medium text-sm transition-all text-center"
          >
            Calculate Stamp Duty
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
